# ok @1-96 bass Eb2: pedal tone under slash chords
# ok @49-64 bass C2: pedal tone under slash chords
#
# chords: Ebmaj7 F/Eb Gm7/Eb Abmaj7/Eb Ebmaj7 F/Eb Bb/Eb Abmaj7/Eb Ebmaj7 F/Eb Gm7/Eb Abmaj7/Eb Ebadd9 Bb/Eb Fm7/Eb Ebmaj7
