# 1-16: First light: air, drone, single piano notes
# 17-32: Choir states theme over pad; harmony moves over Eb pedal
# 33-48: Bells answer; harmony continues over Eb pedal
# 49-64: Turn to C minor; fullest section; heartbeat kick
# 65-80: Sun breaks through: back to Eb Lydian, theme in full and highest
# 81-96: Settling: parts leave one by one to drone and last piano note
#
